    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels different this time. it's not just \"stress\" or being sad. it's like there's this core part of me that's just gone. like everything that's happened just permanently changed the wiring. i look at people who \"bounce back\" and i just don't see myself in them at all. it's like i'm a fundamentally different, broken thing. it's not something a therapist or some breathing exercises can fix. some things are just meant to stay broken, you know? is no of that anymore a thing?",
